Vendored third-party Next.js app-router applications
=====================================================

The application source under integration/next-real/<name>/ is vendored,
pinned, and unmodified (except package.json dependency version pins) from
third-party open-source projects. Each app carries a copy of its upstream
LICENSE. Attribution per app follows.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
