-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Both apps are verified hermetic: they read only local files at build time
and perform no request-time network, database, or secret access. The only
external references are static anchor hrefs (nextjs.org / vercel.com links)
in rendered HTML, which are never fetched by the build or the smoke test.
